            "review_title": "Review at Buff Brewer - Craft Beer Taproom & Brewery",
            "review_text": "ef1718\nHuntington Beach, California46 contributions\n0\nGreat Brewpub\nFeb 2023 • Solo\nInteresting name for a brewpub so I decided to stop by. Cool decor on the outside and inside of the establishment. This is a small place but has a nice variety of their own brews on tap and guest taps. So nice to have a craft beer as I was burned out from drinking the Vietnamese local beers. I tried their hazy IPA and it hit the spot. Met the owner and he was cool. I wish this place was closer to my hotel. Will definitely be back if I'm in Danang again.\nWritten February 23, 2023",
